en.effect:
Place 1 "Raise Moon" card from your Deck on top of your Deck, except "Stars of Raise Moon" (each unique card name can only be placed once per turn, by you, by this effect of "Stars of Raise Moon"), also for the rest of this turn after this card resolves, neither player can add cards from their Main Deck to their hand, except by drawing them. You can banish this card from your GY, then activate 1 of these effects;
● Each player draws 1 card.
● If you control a Spellcaster "Raise Moon" Xyz Monster: Draw 1 card.
